# Successor Clang qualifier: review before execution

This directory repairs a qualification-policy error. The original campaign,
plan02 marker, existing exports, run records and failed PDM qualification remain
byte-unchanged. It has no run/build/configure/lint/export command. The six original
full Clang lint runs can be reused after their actual terminal success.

`repair.py` imports the original campaign at its real location and calls its
complete `checked()` before/after each approved phase. It never replaces a
function or changes the imported module's globals or paths. New qualification
orchestration uses the original source/overlay/header/lint/frontend helpers with
new output directories. The original GCC qualifier's reserve-only configuration
policy is unchanged. `config_policy.py` requires all 14 exact typed/presence-aware
Clang transitions and compares the entire normalized configuration.

